          "short": "$\\frac{1}{4}$",
          "worked": "There are 13 Hearts in 52 cards.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{Heart})&=\\frac{13}{52}\\\\P(\\text{Heart})&=\\frac{1}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
